        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jordan Mark Witzigreuter\n- Roles: American singer-songwriter\n- Projects: The Ready Set, Cell, I'm Alive, I'm Dreaming\n- Places: Fort Wayne, Indiana, New York\n- Topics: electropop, grunge, college rock, alternative\n\nFacts:\n- Jordan Mark Witzigreuter was born on November 14, 1989.\n- Jordan Mark Witzigreuter is an American singer-songwriter from Fort Wayne, Indiana.\n- Jordan Mark Witzigreuter is professionally known as The Ready Set.\n- Cell were a New York-based band.\n- Cell were often labeled grunge because of their era, though college rock or alternative may describe them more accurately.\n- I'm Alive, I'm Dreaming is the second studio album by the American electropop singer-songwriter The Ready Set.",
